NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000834 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000835 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000836 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000837 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000838 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000839 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000840 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000841 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000842 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000843 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000844 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000845 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000846 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000847 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000848 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000849 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000850 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
